  "id": "values-education",
  "term": "values education",
  "definition": "Values education is the educational process of helping people acquire, internalize, and act on shared values that shape behavior, attitudes, and character. It is intended to support affective as well as cognitive development and is carried out through schools together with teachers, families, and the wider community.",
